# Documentation lives in the GitHub wiki, not in-repo. This guards against
# accidentally committing local docs or process artifacts (e.g. plan/spec
# scratch from tooling) under docs/.
/docs/

# Analysis / planning scratch generated at repo root by tooling (kept local,
# never committed) — e.g. *_IMPROVEMENTS.md coverage write-ups.
/*_IMPROVEMENTS.md
*.img
